{
  "id": 423928375,
  "iid": 21881,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "OSPF: Print \"Auth Crypt Sequence Number\" in hexadecimal",
  "description": "```\nRFC 5613 - OSPF Link-Local Signaling\n\"2.5.  Cryptographic Authentication TLV (OSPFv2 ONLY)\n ...\n The cryptographic sequence number is included in the TLV and MUST be\n the same as the one in the OSPFv2 authentication data for the LLS block\n to be considered authentic.\"\n\nThus it's better to print \"Auth Crypt Sequence Number\" in hexadecimal\ninstead of decimal as LLS \"Sequence number\" is.\n\nbefore:\n        Auth Crypt Sequence Number: 1518551314\n            Sequence number: 0x5a834112\n\nafter:\n        Auth Crypt Sequence Number: 0x5a834112\n            Sequence number: 0x5a834112\n```\nExample with:\n[OSPFv2.pcapng](/uploads/3a4e0032c0484911be260438ae9c5fe9/OSPFv2.pcapng)",
  "state": "merged",
